				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1693853/scp-231-j#post-4257253</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 22 May 2019 09:39:44 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Researcher Toast</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5376329</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I know how to fix it!</p> <p>We send them a fake cheque, roughtly triple the price of what we owe.<br /> We demand the money back we overpayed.<br /> We get paid back double what we owe.<br /> She goes to the bank, tries to cash the cheque, and turns out it's a fake!<br /> We flee to a third-world country, being virtual trillionaires.<br /> Nothing can stop us, even if she finds us, we can pay her back and still have the amount we owe left over.</p> <p>And I want diplomatic immunity in Russia, thank you very much.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
